Software this project builds on (not included in this repository)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Dockerfile builds on the Local Inference Lab vLLM image
(ghcr.io/local-inference-lab/vllm), which provides the serving stack this
plugin extends: vLLM (Apache-2.0), the B12X kernels (Apache-2.0), FlashInfer
(Apache-2.0), DSpark speculative decoding, and NVIDIA CUDA components under
NVIDIA's own licenses. Their licenses apply to the image and to anything built
from it.
